MARK STATEMENTS
STATEMENT NextStateARM8_erase (E1-0003 text) typechecks true free_vars [s::arm8_state]
s.PSTATE.EL = 0w ∧ s.exception = NoException ∧
(¬s.SCTLR_EL1.SA0 ∨ aligned 4 s.SP_EL0) ∧
(∀t. NextStateARM8 (erase s) = SOME t ⇒ untagged t.PC) ⇒
